<title>USA: Martin Lawrence files Chapter 11.</title>
<headline>Martin Lawrence files Chapter 11.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Lawrence Limited Editions Inc said it filed for Chapter 11 under the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to disclose its assets and liabilities.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it has decided to close several galleries due to declining sales. It said it believes it can successfully reorganize and expects to emerge from Chapter 11 within 12 to 18 months.</p>
<p>Martin Lawrence Limited Editions is a publisher and retailer of limited-edition serigraphs, lithographs, sculpture and other works of fine art.</p>
